// Nico's house, part 76: the bathroom and the hall / laundry nook.
// Bathroom: tiled tub-shower on the north wall (curtain on rings, shower head, valve, running water + steam), toilet with a
// working lid and flush handle, one-piece vanity with a faucet, a medicine cabinet whose mirror door opens, towels, toiletries,
// linen shelves, exhaust fan and lights on the wall switch, mildew. Hall: stacked washer-dryer, detergent shelf, breaker panel
// (door opens), coat hooks (rain jacket, hat, dive mask), boot tray, broom, tide clock, ceiling light on its switch.
// Interactions: shower, toilet, faucet, medicine_cabinet, switch_bath, breaker_panel, switch_hall.
// Lights: bath_ceiling, bath_vanity, hall_ceiling.
export const order = 76;

